Topology Setup
End Devices: 2 PCs (PC0, PC1)

Intermediary Device: 1 Cisco 2960 Switch

IP Addressing:

PC0: 192.168.1.2/24

PC1: 192.168.1.3/24

Simulation Workflow
PDU Generation: A Simple PDU (ICMP) is sent from PC0 to PC1.

Error Injection: A bit-flipping error is conceptually simulated during the "Inbound PDU Details" phase.

Verification: The parity or CRC bits are compared at the destination to detect or correct the error.

